<Layout title="About Us | RO Service Support">
  <section class="page-section">
    <div class="container">
      <h1 class="page-title">About Our Water Purifier Service Center</h1>
      <div class="page-content">
        <p>Welcome to RO Service Support, your trusted local partner for all water purifier needs in Bangalore. With over 20,000+ satisfied customers, we have established ourselves as a leading service center dedicated to providing safe, pure, and healthy drinking water to every household and office.</p>
        
        <h2>Our Mission</h2>
        <p>We understand that clean drinking water is not a luxury, but a basic necessity. Our mission is simple: to ensure that no family has to compromise on their health due to a faulty water purifier. We strive to provide fast, reliable, and affordable doorstep repair and maintenance services.</p>
        
        <h2>Why We Are Different</h2>
        <p>Finding a good technician is hard. That is why we have built a team of background-verified, highly trained professionals. We don't believe in hidden charges or unnecessary part replacements. We diagnose the problem honestly and use only 100% genuine spare parts, backed by a 90-day written warranty.</p>
        
        <h2>Our Expertise</h2>
        <p>Whether you own a Kent, Aquaguard, Pureit, or any other brand, our experts are equipped to handle all types of RO, UV, and UF water purifiers. From complex motor repairs to simple filter changes, we do it all at your doorstep.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>